328 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 237 0 R
/E (Liberating Structures are powerful facilitation techniques designed to engage and empower groups of any size to collaborate, innovate, and solve problems together. Unlike traditional, top-down approaches, Liberating Structures provide a set of easy-to-learn methods that unleash everyone's potential by fostering inclusive, participatory, and creative environments. Each structure is adaptable and designed to include every voice, encourage fresh ideas, and lead to more effective, sustainable solutions. Whether used in workshops, meetings, or strategic planning sessions, Liberating Structures help teams work together more effectively, fostering alignment and ownership.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
