549 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 259 0 R
/E (If I would join only conference per year, it would probably be XP Days Benelux. Because it has this extra thing that makes you join again. This dimension that no matter your mindset while joining, you can be sure to have an amazing experience: from the relax vibe of the organisers, to their professionalism, to the networking moments between the sessions, to the high quality workshops and talks on the agenda, to the various evening activities \(from board game nights to drinks at the bar\), to the simple fact of meeting friendly faces again year after year... XP Days Benelux was the very first Agile conference I ever joined, and will probably be the last one as well!)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
